# @intent: 「反應式渲染 GUI 開發平台」的最小計算核心模型（簡化：狀態更新後重新計算派生渲染值，無 GUI 與 I/O）
fn update_state(state: i32, delta: i32) -> i32 { state + delta }
fn render(state: i32, visible: bool) -> i32 {
    if visible { state } else { 0 }
}
fn main() {
    let initial = 10;
    let updated = update_state(initial, 3);
    let frame = render(updated, true);
    frame
}
